   "d": "2021-11-08",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY21",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our 2021 guidance remains unchanged from the improved underlying position outlined at the interim results and is underpinned by continuing good operational performance.",
   "file": "20211108_BA_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-02-24",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "The three-year cash flow target for the period 2020 to 2022, originally set at £3.5bn to £3.8bn, has been upgraded to be in excess of £4bn.",
   "file": "20220224_BA_BAE-Systems-Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-05-05",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "\"Trading in the first quarter has been in line with expectations with strong order intake and good operational performance being maintained.",
   "file": "20220505_BA_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-07-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Group's full year 2022 guidance across all metrics is unchanged from that provided at the Preliminary announcement on 24 February 2022, which was provided on the basis of an exchange rate of $1.38:£1 for the year.",
   "file": "20220728_BA_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-15",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The full year Group 2022 guidance across all metrics is unchanged on a constant currency basis from the Preliminary Announcement on 24 February 2022.",
   "file": "20221115_BA_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-23",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Brad Greve, Group Finance Director said, \"We've delivered sales, underlying EPS and free cash flow all above guidance which is a testament to our people and their continued, long-term focus on operational excellence.",
   "file": "20230223_BA_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-04",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The Group's full year 2023 guidance is unchanged from the Preliminary announcement on 23 February 2023.",
   "file": "20230504_BA_AGM-Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-08-02",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 2,
   "q": "Underlying EBIT guidance is increased by 200 bps to 6% to 8%, reflecting the sales profile and good operational performance.",
   "file": "20230802_BA_Half-year-Report.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-11-13",
   "doc": "Q3 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "\"Trading has been in line with the upgraded guidance we issued at the time of our 2023 half-year results.",
   "file": "20231113_BA_Trading-Statement.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-21",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "RAISE",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "On a constant currency basis, we grew order backlog by 21%, sales by 9% and underlying EPS by 14%. We delivered a record free cash flow of £2.6bn for the year and, as a result, exceeded our stated three-year free cash flow target for 2021 to 2023.",
   "file": "20240221_BA_Final-Results.md"
  },
  {
